msgctxt "help:res.user,web_user:"
msgid "Recipient of this user's video surveillance notices."
msgstr "Destinatari dels avisos de videovigilància d'aquest usuari."

msgctxt "help:videovigilance.alarm,camera:"
msgid "Empty for alarms that do not belong to a specific camera."
msgstr "Buida en les alarmes que no són d'una càmera concreta."

msgctxt "help:videovigilance.alarm,event:"
msgid "Detection that triggered the alarm."
msgstr "Detecció que ha provocat l'alarma."

msgctxt "help:videovigilance.alarm,frame:"
msgid ""
"Last image of the camera when the notice of an outage or recovery was "
"raised."
msgstr ""
"Darrera imatge de la càmera quan va saltar l'avís d'una caiguda o "
"recuperació."

msgctxt "help:videovigilance.alarm.call,state:"
msgid ""
"'Started' means the PBX accepted the order to call, not that the manager "
"answered."
msgstr ""
"«Iniciada» vol dir que la centraleta ha acceptat la ordre de trucar, no que "
"l'encarregat hagi respost."

msgctxt "help:videovigilance.alarm.call,voice:"
msgid "The PBX read the alarm to the manager. If not, the phone only rang."
msgstr ""
"La centraleta ha llegit l'alarma a l'encarregat. Si no, només ha sonat."

msgctxt "help:videovigilance.alarm.call,voice_error:"
msgid "Why the alarm was not read. The call was made anyway."
msgstr "Per què no s'ha llegit l'alarma. La trucada s'ha fet igualment."

msgctxt "help:videovigilance.camera,code:"
msgid "Unique and stable identifier of the camera."
msgstr "Identificador únic i estable de la càmera."

msgctxt "help:videovigilance.camera,detect_motion:"
msgid ""
"Creates an event when a person moves in the image. A person standing still "
"does not create one."
msgstr ""
"Genera un esdeveniment quan una persona es mou a la imatge. Una persona "
"quieta no en genera."

msgctxt "help:videovigilance.camera,detect_persons:"
msgid "Creates an event when there is a person in the image, moving or not."
msgstr ""
"Genera un esdeveniment quan hi ha una persona a la imatge, es mogui o no."

msgctxt "help:videovigilance.camera,firmware_version:"
msgid "Reported by the camera over ONVIF, through the detection service."
msgstr "La informa la càmera per ONVIF, a través del servei de detecció."

msgctxt "help:videovigilance.camera,frame:"
msgid ""
"Last image the detection service sent with the heartbeat. It is kept even if"
" the camera goes down. It is stored in the table and not in the file store: "
"it changes at every heartbeat."
msgstr ""
"Darrera imatge que el servei de detecció ha enviat amb el batec. Es conserva"
" encara que la càmera caigui. Es desa a la taula i no al magatzem de "
"fitxers: es canvia a cada batec."

msgctxt "help:videovigilance.camera,host:"
msgid "IP address or DNS name, without protocol, port or credentials."
msgstr "Adreça IP o nom DNS, sense protocol, port ni credencials."

msgctxt "help:videovigilance.camera,location:"
msgid ""
"Where the camera is. The managers of the location are the ones called when a"
" person alarm goes off."
msgstr ""
"On és la càmera. Els encarregats de la ubicació són a qui es truca quan "
"salta una alarma de persona."

msgctxt "help:videovigilance.camera,password:"
msgid ""
"Password of the camera. It is stored encrypted and cannot be read back; "
"leave it as it is to keep it."
msgstr ""
"Contrasenya de la càmera. Es desa xifrada i no es pot tornar a consultar; "
"deixeu-la com està per conservar-la."

msgctxt "help:videovigilance.camera,ptz_moved_at:"
msgid ""
"When the last movement of the camera was ordered from the web. For a few "
"seconds no notices of events of this camera are sent, because when it moves "
"the whole scene shifts and looks like motion."
msgstr ""
"Quan es va ordenar l'últim moviment de la càmera des de la web. Durant uns "
"segons no s'envien avisos d'esdeveniments d'aquesta càmera, perquè en "
"moure's tota l'escena es desplaça i sembla moviment."

msgctxt "help:videovigilance.camera,rotation:"
msgid ""
"Rotation to apply to the image so that people appear upright (e.g. 180° if "
"the camera is mounted upside down)."
msgstr ""
"Rotació que cal aplicar a la imatge perquè les persones surtin dretes (p. "
"ex. 180° si la càmera està muntada al revés)."

msgctxt "help:videovigilance.camera,secondary_stream_path:"
msgid "Optional relative RTSP path, for example stream2."
msgstr "Ruta RTSP relativa opcional, per exemple stream2."

msgctxt "help:videovigilance.camera,status:"
msgid ""
"Status of the camera according to the detection service (camera heartbeat). "
"It stays until the next heartbeat."
msgstr ""
"Estat de la càmera segons el servei de detecció (batec de càmeres). Es manté"
" fins al següent batec."

msgctxt "help:videovigilance.camera,stream_path:"
msgid "Relative RTSP path, for example stream1. Without credentials."
msgstr "Ruta RTSP relativa, per exemple stream1. Sense credencials."

msgctxt "help:videovigilance.configuration,alarm_armed:"
msgid "If disabled, events are recorded anyway but no notice is sent."
msgstr ""
"Si està desactivada, els esdeveniments es registren igualment però no "
"s'envia cap avís."

msgctxt "help:videovigilance.configuration,call_cooldown:"
msgid ""
"After calling the managers of a location they are not called again until "
"this time has passed (failed calls do not count). 0 to call at every alarm."
msgstr ""
"Després de trucar als encarregats d'una ubicació no es torna a trucar fins "
"que passi aquest temps (les trucades fallides no compten). 0 per trucar a "
"cada alarma."

msgctxt "help:videovigilance.configuration,call_voice:"
msgid ""
"The PBX calls the manager and reads the alarm (location, camera, time and "
"persons), generated with Google Text-to-Speech. If the voice cannot be "
"generated or played, the call is made anyway (it only rings)."
msgstr ""
"La centraleta truca a l'encarregat i li llegeix l'alarma (ubicació, càmera, "
"hora i persones), generada amb Google Text-to-Speech. Si la veu no es pot "
"generar o reproduir, es truca igualment (només sona)."

msgctxt "help:videovigilance.configuration,call_voice_name:"
msgid ""
"Name of the Google Text-to-Speech voice, e.g. es-ES-Standard-A; the language"
" comes from the name. GOOGLE_APPLICATION_CREDENTIALS is required in the "
"trytond environment."
msgstr ""
"Nom de la veu de Google Text-to-Speech, p. ex. es-ES-Standard-A; l'idioma "
"surt del nom. Cal GOOGLE_APPLICATION_CREDENTIALS a l'entorn de trytond."

msgctxt "help:videovigilance.configuration,camera_heartbeat_failures:"
msgid ""
"Consecutive failed checks before a camera is considered down and an alert is"
" raised. Avoids false alerts caused by brief outages."
msgstr ""
"Comprovacions consecutives fallides abans de donar una càmera per caiguda i "
"avisar. Evita falsos avisos per talls puntuals."

msgctxt "help:videovigilance.configuration,camera_heartbeat_interval:"
msgid ""
"Every how many seconds the service checks that each camera responds and "
"delivers video."
msgstr ""
"Cada quants segons el servei comprova que cada càmera respon i entrega "
"vídeo."

msgctxt "help:videovigilance.configuration,ptz_quiet_seconds:"
msgid ""
"Seconds during which no notices of events of a camera are sent after it has "
"been moved from the web: when it moves, the whole scene shifts and the "
"detector takes it for motion. Events are recorded anyway. 0 to never "
"silence."
msgstr ""
"Segons durant els quals no s'envien avisos d'esdeveniments d'una càmera "
"després d'haver-la mogut des de la web: en moure's, tota l'escena es "
"desplaça i el detector ho pren per moviment. Els esdeveniments es registren "
"igualment. 0 per no silenciar mai."

msgctxt "help:videovigilance.configuration,service_heartbeat_interval:"
msgid "Every how many seconds the detection service communicates with Tryton."
msgstr "Cada quants segons el servei de detecció es comunica amb Tryton."

msgctxt "help:videovigilance.configuration,service_heartbeat_misses:"
msgid ""
"Missed heartbeats, in addition to the one that is due, before warning that "
"the service does not respond: the service is considered down once the "
"interval times (heartbeats + 1) has passed. It is checked at every interval."
msgstr ""
"Batecs perduts, a més del que ja toca, abans d'avisar que el servei no "
"respon: es dona el servei per caigut passat l'interval per (batecs + 1). Es "
"revisa a cada interval."

msgctxt "help:videovigilance.configuration,yeastar_caller:"
msgid ""
"Number of the PBX the calls are made from: an extension, an IVR, a ring "
"group or a queue. If it is an extension, that extension rings first."
msgstr ""
"Número de la centraleta des del qual es truca: una extensió, una IVR, un "
"grup de timbre o una cua. Si és una extensió, sonarà primer aquesta "
"extensió."

msgctxt "help:videovigilance.configuration,yeastar_dial_permission:"
msgid ""
"Extension of the PBX that has permission for external calls: the PBX uses it"
" to call the managers when the alarm is read."
msgstr ""
"Extensió de la centraleta que té permís de trucades externes: la centraleta "
"l'usa per trucar als encarregats quan es llegeix l'alarma."

msgctxt "help:videovigilance.configuration,yeastar_pbx:"
msgid ""
"PBX that makes the calls to the managers. Without a PBX nobody is called."
msgstr ""
"Centraleta que fa les trucades als encarregats. Sense centraleta no es truca"
" a ningú."

msgctxt "help:videovigilance.event,directions:"
msgid "Where the camera moved to, in the order it happened."
msgstr "Cap a on s'ha mogut la càmera, en l'ordre en què s'ha fet."

msgctxt "help:videovigilance.event,ended_at:"
msgid "Empty while the camera is still moving."
msgstr "Buit mentre la càmera encara es mou."

msgctxt "help:videovigilance.event,start_frame:"
msgid ""
"Image just before it started to move (only if someone was watching the live "
"video)."
msgstr ""
"Imatge just abans de començar a moure's (només si algú mirava el vídeo en "
"directe)."

msgctxt "help:videovigilance.event,uid:"
msgid ""
"Unique identifier generated by the detection service; avoids duplicates on "
"retries."
msgstr ""
"Identificador únic generat pel servei de detecció; evita duplicats en els "
"reintents."

msgctxt "help:videovigilance.event,user:"
msgid "Who moved the camera."
msgstr "Qui ha mogut la càmera."

msgctxt "help:videovigilance.location,managers:"
msgid ""
"People called when a person alarm goes off on a camera of this location. "
"They are all called at once."
msgstr ""
"Persones a qui es truca quan salta una alarma de persona en una càmera "
"d'aquesta ubicació. Es truca a tots alhora."

msgctxt "help:videovigilance.location.manager,phone:"
msgid "Number to call. Digits only (the + becomes 00)."
msgstr "Número al qual es truca. Només xifres (el + es converteix en 00)."

